{"resourceIdentifier":"898","resourceName":"Fuelling a greener future for farmers in Malawi through the use of Jatropha curcas","description":"The project is a re-vegetation activity aimed at utilising degraded and marginal land for the establishment of Jatropha Curcas hedgerows, mainly along fields and homesteads. Jatropha is a tree of the Euphorbaciae family, whose seeds contain about 30-35% oil, which can be extracted by crushing and expelling, and cleaned to produce bio fuel. In this case, production of bio fuel is intended for domestic use in Malawi. The project works with an extensive network of predominantly smallholder farmers across the country to establish Jatropha as a viable additional cash crop.","location":{"latitude":-13.975728,"longitude":33.731211},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"898"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Central Region"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Bio Energy Resources Limited (BERL)"},{"type":"string","value":"Arkhangelsk Region, Russian Federation"},{"type":"string","value":"www.sawmill25.ru"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"863"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0002"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"228 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tuev Sued Industrie Service GmbH (Tuev Sued)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/04/2020"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_P